# Rocky Linux 9 (RHEL family). Default cloud user: rocky. NIC comes up as eth0
# (image sets net.ifnames=0).
# PITFALL: RHEL-family GRUB uses gfxterm and STALLS at boot on a headless serial
# console. A FRAMEBUFFER is required. The plugin auto-attaches one for detected
# RHEL-family guests, but declaring it explicitly is clearest.
VM
CPU 2
MEM 2G
BOOTROM uefi
DISK disk0 20G source=https://dl.rockylinux.org/pub/rocky/9/images/x86_64/Rocky-9-GenericCloud-Base.latest.x86_64.qcow2
NIC jailbridge
CLOUDINIT user-data
NETWORK_CONFIG network-config
FRAMEBUFFER 127.0.0.1:5900
OS Rocky-9
ADDRESS 192.0.2.11
